# ludic.i18n - a game in any language from gettext files anyone can add: the English stays in the
# code, a .po is keyed by the English as drawn, exact lines, patterns with holes, paragraphs a
# sentence at a time, plurals, a mod folder and a font per language. Uses nothing. See README.md.
package "ludic.i18n"
version "0.1.0"
kind source
